   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The sound of the digraph «lh»",
     "texto": [
      "The letters **l** and **h** form an indivisible digraph: **filho** (son), **filha** (daughter), **trabalho** (work), **mulher** (woman).",
      "The «l» and the «h» are never pronounced separately with aspiration; they are articulated by pressing the back of the tongue against the hard palate.",
      "Many iconic Portuguese surnames have this digraph, such as **Carvalho**, **Coelho** or **Magalhães**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
